WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: de

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:13.100
[Musik]

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.400
&gt;&gt; SALLY: Hallo!

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.400
